This is where I'll be sharing practical guides, honest comparisons, and tutorials on building a real online presence as a small business.

## What to expect

I'll write about the questions I actually get asked by clients and business owners:

- **Comparisons** — WordPress vs custom code, WooCommerce vs Shopify, and other decisions that matter
- **Tutorials** — how to do specific things without needing a developer
- **Freelancing** — what to expect when you hire a web developer, how to scope a project, what things actually cost
- **AI and tools** — practical uses of AI in small business websites

## Why I'm writing this

Most "web development" content is written for developers. This is written for the people who actually need websites — small business owners, founders, freelancers just getting started.

No jargon. No assumptions. Just honest explanations of what things cost, what's worth it, and what to avoid.

## How often

I'll publish whenever I have something genuinely useful to say — probably once or twice a month.

If you want to be notified when new posts go live, subscribe at the bottom of any page, or reach out on [X](https://x.com/msaad_alam).